{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","clause_number":"5.1","title":"5.1.糖尿病用藥 Drugs used in diabetes","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":83,"pdf_page_end":83,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002760","raw_text":"5.1.糖尿病用藥 Drugs used in diabetes","display_text":"5.1.糖尿病用藥 Drugs used in diabetes","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2185]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002761","raw_text":"1.藥品種類(105/5/1)","display_text":"1.藥品種類(105/5/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2186]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002762","raw_text":"(1)胰島素：各廠牌短、中、長效、速效或預混型胰島素。","display_text":"(1)胰島素：各廠牌短、中、長效、速效或預混型胰島素。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2187]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002763","raw_text":"(2)Biguanides：如metformin。","display_text":"(2)Biguanides：如metformin。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2188]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002764","raw_text":"(3)Sulfonylureas(SU)：如chlorpropamide、glipizide、glimepiride等。","display_text":"(3)Sulfonylureas(SU)：如chlorpropamide、glipizide、glimepiride等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2189]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002765","raw_text":"(4)Meglitinide：如repaglinide、nateglinide等。","display_text":"(4)Meglitinide：如repaglinide、nateglinide等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2190]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002766","raw_text":"(5)α-glucosidase inhibitor：如acarbose、miglitol等。","display_text":"(5)α-glucosidase inhibitor：如acarbose、miglitol等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2191]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002767","raw_text":"(6)Thiazolidinediones(TZD)：如 rosiglitazone、pioglitazone等。","display_text":"(6)Thiazolidinediones(TZD)：如 rosiglitazone、pioglitazone等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2192]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002768","raw_text":"(7)DPP-4抑制劑：如sitagliptin、vildagliptin、saxagliptin、linagliptin等。","display_text":"(7)DPP-4抑制劑：如sitagliptin、vildagliptin、saxagliptin、linagliptin等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2193]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002769","raw_text":"(8)GLP-1受體促效劑：如exenatide、liraglutide等。","display_text":"(8)GLP-1受體促效劑：如exenatide、liraglutide等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2194]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002770","raw_text":"(9)SGLT-2抑制劑：如empagliflozin、dapagliflozin等。","display_text":"(9)SGLT-2抑制劑：如empagliflozin、dapagliflozin等。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2195]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002771","raw_text":"(10)各降血糖成分之口服複方製劑。","display_text":"(10)各降血糖成分之口服複方製劑。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2196]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002772","raw_text":"2. 使用條件：(105/5/1、114/6/1)","display_text":"2. 使用條件：(105/5/1、114/6/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2197]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002773","raw_text":"(1)\t原則上第二型糖尿病治療應優先使用metformin，或考慮早期開始使用胰島素。除有過敏、禁忌症、不能耐受或仍無法理想控制血糖的情形下，可使用其他類口服降血糖藥物。","display_text":"(1)\t原則上第二型糖尿病治療應優先使用metformin，或考慮早期開始使用胰島素。除有過敏、禁忌症、不能耐受或仍無法理想控制血糖的情形下，可使用其他類口服降血糖藥物。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2198]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002774","raw_text":"(2) TZD製劑、DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑、以及含該3類成分之複方製劑，限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病病人，且SGLT-2抑制劑與DPP-4抑制劑及其複方製劑宜二種擇一種使用。","display_text":"(2) TZD製劑、DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑、以及含該3類成分之複方製劑，限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病病人，且SGLT-2抑制劑與DPP-4抑制劑及其複方製劑宜二種擇一種使用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2199]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002775","raw_text":"(3)\t第二型糖尿病病人倘於使用三種口服降血糖藥物治療仍無法理想控制血糖者，宜考慮給予胰島素治療。","display_text":"(3)\t第二型糖尿病病人倘於使用三種口服降血糖藥物治療仍無法理想控制血糖者，宜考慮給予胰島素治療。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2200]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002776","raw_text":"(4)\t特約醫療院所應加強衛教第二型糖尿病病人，鼓勵健康生活型態的飲食和運動，如控制肥胖、限制熱量攝取等措施。","display_text":"(4)\t特約醫療院所應加強衛教第二型糖尿病病人，鼓勵健康生活型態的飲食和運動，如控制肥胖、限制熱量攝取等措施。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2201]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002777","raw_text":"5.1.1.Acarbose (如Glucobay)；miglitol (如Diaban)（86/1/1、87/4/1、89/6/1、91/7/1、98/12/1）","display_text":"5.1.1.Acarbose (如Glucobay)；miglitol (如Diaban)（86/1/1、87/4/1、89/6/1、91/7/1、98/12/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2202]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002778","raw_text":"限用於非胰島素依賴型糖尿病之治療。","display_text":"限用於非胰島素依賴型糖尿病之治療。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2203]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002779","raw_text":"5.1.2.Guar gum (如Guarina；Guarem )限糖尿病治療使用。","display_text":"5.1.2.Guar gum (如Guarina；Guarem )限糖尿病治療使用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2204]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002780","raw_text":"5.1.3.GLP-1受體促效劑(105/8/1、107/4/1、108/7/1)","display_text":"5.1.3.GLP-1受體促效劑(105/8/1、107/4/1、108/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2205]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002781","raw_text":"5.1.3.1.Exenatide(如Byetta)(100/5/1、105/5/1、107/4/1)","display_text":"5.1.3.1.Exenatide(如Byetta)(100/5/1、105/5/1、107/4/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2206]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002782","raw_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病患者。","display_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病患者。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2207]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002783","raw_text":"2.本藥品不得與insulin、DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑等藥物併用。","display_text":"2.本藥品不得與insulin、DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑等藥物併用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2208]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002784","raw_text":"5.1.3.2. Liraglutide (如Victoza)、dulaglutide (如Trulicity)、lixisenatide(如Lyxumia) 、semaglutide（如Ozempic）(101/10/1、105/5/1、105/8/1、107/4/1、107/7/1、109/5/1、109/8/1、109/9/1、109/12/1)","display_text":"5.1.3.2. Liraglutide (如Victoza)、dulaglutide (如Trulicity)、lixisenatide(如Lyxumia) 、semaglutide（如Ozempic）(101/10/1、105/5/1、105/8/1、107/4/1、107/7/1、109/5/1、109/8/1、109/9/1、109/12/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2209]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002785","raw_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6個月之後，HbA1c仍高於8.5%以上之第二型糖尿病患者：(109/5/1)","display_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6個月之後，HbA1c仍高於8.5%以上之第二型糖尿病患者：(109/5/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2210]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002786","raw_text":"(1)SGLT-2抑制劑","display_text":"(1)SGLT-2抑制劑","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2211]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002787","raw_text":"(2)DPP-4抑制劑","display_text":"(2)DPP-4抑制劑","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2212]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002788","raw_text":"(3)SGLT-2抑制劑合併DPP-4抑制劑複方藥品","display_text":"(3)SGLT-2抑制劑合併DPP-4抑制劑複方藥品","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2213]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002789","raw_text":"(4)Insulin","display_text":"(4)Insulin","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2214]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002790","raw_text":"2.當患者已接受前述口服降血糖藥物，及/或基礎胰島素治療仍未達理想血糖控制時，與口服降血糖藥物及/或基礎胰島素併用。","display_text":"2.當患者已接受前述口服降血糖藥物，及/或基礎胰島素治療仍未達理想血糖控制時，與口服降血糖藥物及/或基礎胰島素併用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2215]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002791","raw_text":"3.發生重大心血管事件，如心肌梗塞、接受冠狀動脈或其他動脈血管再通術(revascularization)、動脈硬化相關之缺血性腦中風等之病人，於接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin後，仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病患者，可考慮不須使用其他口服降血糖藥品而考慮使用liraglutide或dulaglutide或semaglutide。(109/12/1)","display_text":"3.發生重大心血管事件，如心肌梗塞、接受冠狀動脈或其他動脈血管再通術(revascularization)、動脈硬化相關之缺血性腦中風等之病人，於接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin後，仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病患者，可考慮不須使用其他口服降血糖藥品而考慮使用liraglutide或dulaglutide或semaglutide。(109/12/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2216]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002792","raw_text":"4.本藥品不得與DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑併用。","display_text":"4.本藥品不得與DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑併用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2217]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002793","raw_text":"5.109年5月1日前已依生效前之給付規定使用本類藥物之病人，得繼續使用原藥物至醫師更新其處方內容（109/8/1）。","display_text":"5.109年5月1日前已依生效前之給付規定使用本類藥物之病人，得繼續使用原藥物至醫師更新其處方內容（109/8/1）。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2218]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002794","raw_text":"5.1.3.3.含lixisenatide及insulin glargine之複方製劑(如Soliqua)(108/7/1、110/7/1)","display_text":"5.1.3.3.含lixisenatide及insulin glargine之複方製劑(如Soliqua)(108/7/1、110/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2219]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002795","raw_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6個月之後，HbA1c仍高於8.0%以上之第二型糖尿病成人病人：(110/7/1)","display_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6個月之後，HbA1c仍高於8.0%以上之第二型糖尿病成人病人：(110/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2220]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002796","raw_text":"(1)SGLT-2抑制劑","display_text":"(1)SGLT-2抑制劑","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2221]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002797","raw_text":"(2)DPP-4抑制劑","display_text":"(2)DPP-4抑制劑","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2222]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002798","raw_text":"(3)SGLT-2抑制劑合併DPP-4抑制劑複方藥品","display_text":"(3)SGLT-2抑制劑合併DPP-4抑制劑複方藥品","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2223]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002799","raw_text":"(4)Insulin(每日劑量少於60單位)","display_text":"(4)Insulin(每日劑量少於60單位)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2224]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002800","raw_text":"2.本品不得與DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑併用。","display_text":"2.本品不得與DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑併用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2225]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002801","raw_text":"5.1.4.(刪除)(100/8/1、107/10/1)","display_text":"5.1.4.(刪除)(100/8/1、107/10/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2226]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002802","raw_text":"5.1.5.SGLT-2抑制劑及其複方：","display_text":"5.1.5.SGLT-2抑制劑及其複方：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2227]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002803","raw_text":"1.Dapagliflozin (如Forxiga)、empagliflozin (如Jardiance)、canagliflozin (如Canaglu)、ertugliflozin (如Steglatro) (105/5/1、107/3/1、108/7/1)","display_text":"1.Dapagliflozin (如Forxiga)、empagliflozin (如Jardiance)、canagliflozin (如Canaglu)、ertugliflozin (如Steglatro) (105/5/1、107/3/1、108/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2228]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002804","raw_text":"每日最多處方1粒。","display_text":"每日最多處方1粒。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2229]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002805","raw_text":"2.Empagliflozin/metformin 複方(如 Jardiance Duo) (107/3/1)","display_text":"2.Empagliflozin/metformin 複方(如 Jardiance Duo) (107/3/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2230]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002806","raw_text":"每日最多處方2粒。","display_text":"每日最多處方2粒。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2231]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002807","raw_text":"3.Dapagliflozin及metformin 複方(如Xigduo XR)(107/3/1)","display_text":"3.Dapagliflozin及metformin 複方(如Xigduo XR)(107/3/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2232]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002808","raw_text":"每日最多處方1粒。","display_text":"每日最多處方1粒。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2233]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002809","raw_text":"5.1.6.含empagliflozin及linagliptin之複方製劑(如Glyxambi)(108/1/1、109/5/1)","display_text":"5.1.6.含empagliflozin及linagliptin之複方製劑(如Glyxambi)(108/1/1、109/5/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2234]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002810","raw_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","display_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2235]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002811","raw_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用empagliflozin或linagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","display_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用empagliflozin或linagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2236]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002812","raw_text":"5.1.7.含dapagliflozin及saxagliptin之複方製劑(如Qtern)(108/11/1、109/5/1)","display_text":"5.1.7.含dapagliflozin及saxagliptin之複方製劑(如Qtern)(108/11/1、109/5/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2237]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002813","raw_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","display_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2238]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002814","raw_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用dapagliflozin或saxagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","display_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用dapagliflozin或saxagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2239]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002815","raw_text":"5.1.8.含ertugliflozin及sitagliptin之複方製劑(如Steglujan)(109/5/1)","display_text":"5.1.8.含ertugliflozin及sitagliptin之複方製劑(如Steglujan)(109/5/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2240]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002816","raw_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","display_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2241]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002817","raw_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用ertugliflozin或sitagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","display_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用ertugliflozin或sitagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2242]"}],"ancestors":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p002758","raw_text":"第5節 激素及影響內分泌機轉藥物\nHormones & drugs affecting hormonal mechanism","display_text":"第5節 激素及影響內分泌機轉藥物\nHormones & drugs affecting hormonal mechanism","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[2183]"}],"nested_tables":{},"references":[],"missing_source_paragraphs":[],"original_nodes":[{"clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","clause_number":"5.1","parent_clause_id":"PAY-cfdb76fa8b1beee54127","original_text":"5.1.糖尿病用藥 Drugs used in diabetes","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002760"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"1.藥品種類(105/5/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002761"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-b34dc33f5055d1b521ba","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(1)胰島素：各廠牌短、中、長效、速效或預混型胰島素。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002762"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-faddaa11a0b53ea26754","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(2)Biguanides：如metformin。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002763"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-5d8b34dddb3d4f7c90ac","clause_number":"(3)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(3)Sulfonylureas(SU)：如chlorpropamide、glipizide、glimepiride等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002764"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-8ee1ae7c00c5d9c9ee89","clause_number":"(4)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(4)Meglitinide：如repaglinide、nateglinide等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002765"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-53e95ac56e66c1ba8f8f","clause_number":"(5)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(5)α-glucosidase inhibitor：如acarbose、miglitol等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002766"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-13399a435248b864e6bb","clause_number":"(6)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(6)Thiazolidinediones(TZD)：如 rosiglitazone、pioglitazone等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002767"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-5c73d7e816a05796a7d3","clause_number":"(7)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(7)DPP-4抑制劑：如sitagliptin、vildagliptin、saxagliptin、linagliptin等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002768"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-5d48821280d7aae5a543","clause_number":"(8)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(8)GLP-1受體促效劑：如exenatide、liraglutide等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002769"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-48c90be6baa2a73d83aa","clause_number":"(9)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(9)SGLT-2抑制劑：如empagliflozin、dapagliflozin等。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002770"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-afc6421b37c8f5c6982c","clause_number":"(10)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-dd1800fe5d4e6330eea6","original_text":"(10)各降血糖成分之口服複方製劑。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002771"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-023eeb1f8d10995fecbf","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"2. 使用條件：(105/5/1、114/6/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002772"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-7f2e9cb40909936d47eb","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-023eeb1f8d10995fecbf","original_text":"(1)\t原則上第二型糖尿病治療應優先使用metformin，或考慮早期開始使用胰島素。除有過敏、禁忌症、不能耐受或仍無法理想控制血糖的情形下，可使用其他類口服降血糖藥物。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002773"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-a865d817634ef57d5d67","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-023eeb1f8d10995fecbf","original_text":"(2) TZD製劑、DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑、以及含該3類成分之複方製劑，限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病病人，且SGLT-2抑制劑與DPP-4抑制劑及其複方製劑宜二種擇一種使用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002774"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-308ae9794f12e914acf7","clause_number":"(3)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-023eeb1f8d10995fecbf","original_text":"(3)\t第二型糖尿病病人倘於使用三種口服降血糖藥物治療仍無法理想控制血糖者，宜考慮給予胰島素治療。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002775"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-86e4f8cbbd91e4195f2d","clause_number":"(4)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-023eeb1f8d10995fecbf","original_text":"(4)\t特約醫療院所應加強衛教第二型糖尿病病人，鼓勵健康生活型態的飲食和運動，如控制肥胖、限制熱量攝取等措施。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002776"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-3b6e8066840b08c496ca","clause_number":"5.1.1","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.1.Acarbose (如Glucobay)；miglitol (如Diaban)（86/1/1、87/4/1、89/6/1、91/7/1、98/12/1）\n限用於非胰島素依賴型糖尿病之治療。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002777","給付規定-p002778"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-555cd848f61c443a4935","clause_number":"5.1.2","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.2.Guar gum (如Guarina；Guarem )限糖尿病治療使用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002779"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-a24e2723c5b5d2f4007b","clause_number":"5.1.3","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.3.GLP-1受體促效劑(105/8/1、107/4/1、108/7/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002780"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-5ff7dc4f35a3d1678113","clause_number":"5.1.3.1","parent_clause_id":"PAY-a24e2723c5b5d2f4007b","original_text":"5.1.3.1.Exenatide(如Byetta)(100/5/1、105/5/1、107/4/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002781"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-6ec05fd5ed4b41780447","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-5ff7dc4f35a3d1678113","original_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病患者。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002782"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-33c09af457dadc978dfd","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-5ff7dc4f35a3d1678113","original_text":"2.本藥品不得與insulin、DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑等藥物併用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002783"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-daa22aedaf335f9ac048","clause_number":"5.1.3.2","parent_clause_id":"PAY-a24e2723c5b5d2f4007b","original_text":"5.1.3.2. Liraglutide (如Victoza)、dulaglutide (如Trulicity)、lixisenatide(如Lyxumia) 、semaglutide（如Ozempic）(101/10/1、105/5/1、105/8/1、107/4/1、107/7/1、109/5/1、109/8/1、109/9/1、109/12/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002784"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-8d121846dab206288041","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-daa22aedaf335f9ac048","original_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6個月之後，HbA1c仍高於8.5%以上之第二型糖尿病患者：(109/5/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002785"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-cbbcb65f1d419718b33e","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-8d121846dab206288041","original_text":"(1)SGLT-2抑制劑","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002786"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-b97e44bb85db8d8cb162","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-8d121846dab206288041","original_text":"(2)DPP-4抑制劑","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002787"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-07223383d7bf6f17250d","clause_number":"(3)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-8d121846dab206288041","original_text":"(3)SGLT-2抑制劑合併DPP-4抑制劑複方藥品","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002788"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-2786e0fc82537033c47f","clause_number":"(4)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-8d121846dab206288041","original_text":"(4)Insulin","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002789"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-837a04cc4809a041ccf9","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-daa22aedaf335f9ac048","original_text":"2.當患者已接受前述口服降血糖藥物，及/或基礎胰島素治療仍未達理想血糖控制時，與口服降血糖藥物及/或基礎胰島素併用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002790"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-fb2b9f727d9f4016e76f","clause_number":"3.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-daa22aedaf335f9ac048","original_text":"3.發生重大心血管事件，如心肌梗塞、接受冠狀動脈或其他動脈血管再通術(revascularization)、動脈硬化相關之缺血性腦中風等之病人，於接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin後，仍無法理想控制血糖之第二型糖尿病患者，可考慮不須使用其他口服降血糖藥品而考慮使用liraglutide或dulaglutide或semaglutide。(109/12/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002791"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-e4586df214d8268dc53d","clause_number":"4.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-daa22aedaf335f9ac048","original_text":"4.本藥品不得與DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑併用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002792"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-a1026e57d252801cba96","clause_number":"5.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-daa22aedaf335f9ac048","original_text":"5.109年5月1日前已依生效前之給付規定使用本類藥物之病人，得繼續使用原藥物至醫師更新其處方內容（109/8/1）。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002793"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-b620ba7529f48eeb3ac5","clause_number":"5.1.3.3","parent_clause_id":"PAY-a24e2723c5b5d2f4007b","original_text":"5.1.3.3.含lixisenatide及insulin glargine之複方製劑(如Soliqua)(108/7/1、110/7/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002794"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-2dd0c361b9d932f9fe8d","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-b620ba7529f48eeb3ac5","original_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin及/或sulfonylurea類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6個月之後，HbA1c仍高於8.0%以上之第二型糖尿病成人病人：(110/7/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002795"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-1bcb94876e656a28a801","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2dd0c361b9d932f9fe8d","original_text":"(1)SGLT-2抑制劑","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002796"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-c4bc03a43f308c0745eb","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2dd0c361b9d932f9fe8d","original_text":"(2)DPP-4抑制劑","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002797"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-8e41d569be45535f8727","clause_number":"(3)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2dd0c361b9d932f9fe8d","original_text":"(3)SGLT-2抑制劑合併DPP-4抑制劑複方藥品","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002798"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-2dc63e824686f5a98e4e","clause_number":"(4)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2dd0c361b9d932f9fe8d","original_text":"(4)Insulin(每日劑量少於60單位)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002799"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-863d90ed3dfe9df4a50d","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-b620ba7529f48eeb3ac5","original_text":"2.本品不得與DPP-4抑制劑、SGLT-2抑制劑併用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002800"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-c58d716aeb85bc4c01f9","clause_number":"5.1.4","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.4.(刪除)(100/8/1、107/10/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002801"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-19c234326396cabf972a","clause_number":"5.1.5","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.5.SGLT-2抑制劑及其複方：","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002802"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-ce25381ccd1105935543","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-19c234326396cabf972a","original_text":"1.Dapagliflozin (如Forxiga)、empagliflozin (如Jardiance)、canagliflozin (如Canaglu)、ertugliflozin (如Steglatro) (105/5/1、107/3/1、108/7/1)\n每日最多處方1粒。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002803","給付規定-p002804"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-2f9df5f9f7516c9c6fa7","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-19c234326396cabf972a","original_text":"2.Empagliflozin/metformin 複方(如 Jardiance Duo) (107/3/1)\n每日最多處方2粒。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002805","給付規定-p002806"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-d98a36586b642a278a66","clause_number":"3.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-19c234326396cabf972a","original_text":"3.Dapagliflozin及metformin 複方(如Xigduo XR)(107/3/1)\n每日最多處方1粒。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002807","給付規定-p002808"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-d5d5c1a721f884d626d2","clause_number":"5.1.6","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.6.含empagliflozin及linagliptin之複方製劑(如Glyxambi)(108/1/1、109/5/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002809"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-487715f96537e92b4044","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-d5d5c1a721f884d626d2","original_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002810"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-8c738c5c7ec88c7abbfa","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-d5d5c1a721f884d626d2","original_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用empagliflozin或linagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002811"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-2071de217e7a4ad678f4","clause_number":"5.1.7","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.7.含dapagliflozin及saxagliptin之複方製劑(如Qtern)(108/11/1、109/5/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002812"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-4bde3e3ad4249f08caab","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2071de217e7a4ad678f4","original_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002813"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-79e50266b9828ff1b4db","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-2071de217e7a4ad678f4","original_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用dapagliflozin或saxagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002814"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-220ab2a72200db84a108","clause_number":"5.1.8","parent_clause_id":"PAY-17227a24447ee41f6a61","original_text":"5.1.8.含ertugliflozin及sitagliptin之複方製劑(如Steglujan)(109/5/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002815"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-471953e74cb747e14a87","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-220ab2a72200db84a108","original_text":"1.每日限處方1粒。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002816"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-79e57311267d0fd0ffd3","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-220ab2a72200db84a108","original_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用ertugliflozin或sitagliptin治療至少6個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002817"]}],"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p002760","給付規定-p002761","給付規定-p002762","給付規定-p002763","給付規定-p002764","給付規定-p002765","給付規定-p002766","給付規定-p002767","給付規定-p002768","給付規定-p002769","給付規定-p002770","給付規定-p002771","給付規定-p002772","給付規定-p002773","給付規定-p002774","給付規定-p002775","給付規定-p002776","給付規定-p002777","給付規定-p002778","給付規定-p002779","給付規定-p002780","給付規定-p002781","給付規定-p002782","給付規定-p002783","給付規定-p002784","給付規定-p002785","給付規定-p002786","給付規定-p002787","給付規定-p002788","給付規定-p002789","給付規定-p002790","給付規定-p002791","給付規定-p002792","給付規定-p002793","給付規定-p002794","給付規定-p002795","給付規定-p002796","給付規定-p002797","給付規定-p002798","給付規定-p002799","給付規定-p002800","給付規定-p002801","給付規定-p002802","給付規定-p002803","給付規定-p002804","給付規定-p002805","給付規定-p002806","給付規定-p002807","給付規定-p002808","給付規定-p002809","給付規定-p002810","給付規定-p002811","給付規定-p002812","給付規定-p00281